v 3
d
d SSIV: Shift-Share Instrumental Variables for Stata
d
d Version 0.1.0
d
d Author: Claude Code
d Distribution-Date: 20251204
d
d This package implements shift-share (Bartik) instrumental variables estimation
d with modern inference methods and diagnostic checks, following best practices from
d Borusyak, Hull & Jaravel (2025), Goldsmith-Pinkham et al. (2020), and
d Adão, Kolesár & Morales (2019).
d
d Features:
d   - Three estimation methods: classic, AKM, Borusyak
d   - Automatic diagnostics (F-stat, Herfindahl, concentration)
d   - Leave-one-out instruments
d   - Alternative shares robustness
d   - Flexible inference (robust, cluster)
d
d Requires: Stata version 18.0 or higher (may work with 16.0+)
d
d Keywords: instrumental variables, shift-share, Bartik, causal inference
d
d GitHub: https://github.com/MaykolMedrano/Shift-Share-IV-Design
d
f ssiv.ado
f ../help/ssiv.sthlp
